WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.050
Start with how the estate got here.

2
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:07.438
Federal IT reached its current shape in
four eras, and each solved a real problem.

3
00:00:07.438 --> 00:00:12.272
The mainframe held all the data
and also enforced access to it:

4
00:00:12.272 --> 00:00:13.788
one truth, in one box.

5
00:00:13.788 --> 00:00:18.111
Distributed systems put a database
and a directory in every region,

6
00:00:18.111 --> 00:00:21.199
and nobody replaced that
single source of truth.

7
00:00:21.199 --> 00:00:25.966
From 2010, OMB set a target of closing
at least eight hundred data centers,

8
00:00:25.966 --> 00:00:29.302
and agencies stacked
inspection devices between

9
00:00:29.302 --> 00:00:32.400
field offices and the
systems they depended on.

10
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:37.390
Then email moved to Microsoft 365
and workloads spread across clouds,

11
00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:40.488
while identity stayed in regional domains.

12
00:00:40.488 --> 00:00:43.444
Now the same person can
appear as several records,

13
00:00:43.444 --> 00:00:46.112
and no one can say which
one is authoritative.

14
00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:48.112
That's why modernization stalls.

15
00:00:48.112 --> 00:00:51.012
Each step assumes the one
before it is finished.

16
00:00:51.012 --> 00:00:54.288
Zero Trust assumes
authoritative cloud identity.

17
00:00:54.288 --> 00:00:57.038
Cloud identity assumes a clean directory.

18
00:00:57.038 --> 00:00:59.863
A clean directory assumes governed groups.

19
00:00:59.863 --> 00:01:02.346
And governed groups
assume someone owns them,

20
00:01:02.346 --> 00:01:04.437
which is where many agencies are stuck.

21
00:01:04.437 --> 00:01:12.806
Meanwhile the mandates arrive with dates:
M-22-09's Zero Trust goals for fiscal

22
00:01:12.806 --> 00:01:17.269
2024, BOD 25-01's baselines by June 20,

23
00:01:17.269 --> 00:01:21.063
2025, and M-26-14's
logging reset in May 2026.

24
00:01:21.063 --> 00:01:24.087
Each assumes a foundation
the estate never built.

25
00:01:24.087 --> 00:01:27.726
So the first decision is about
ownership, not technology.

26
00:01:27.726 --> 00:01:31.137
Before anything is planned,
name the executive sponsor,

27
00:01:31.137 --> 00:01:35.438
the steward who runs the program
office, and the authorizing official.

28
00:01:35.438 --> 00:01:38.880
The roadmap makes that the entry
condition for its first phase.
